===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|streight}}, {{m|enm|streght}}, {{m|enm|streiȝt}}, the past participle of {{m|enm|strecchen|t=to stretch}}, from {{der|en|ang|streċċan}} (past participle {{m|ang|ġestreaht}}, {{m|ang|ġestreht}}), from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*strakkjan|t=to stretch}}. Doublet of {{l|en|straught}}.

